## 🎯 通用修复模板

### 后端权限修复模板：
```php
public function check_write_permission($request) {
    // BJT认证检查
    $auth_controller = new BJT_Auth_Controller();
    $is_authenticated = $auth_controller->check_auth($request);
    
    if (!$is_authenticated) {
        return new WP_Error('rest_not_logged_in', 'User not authenticated', ['status' => 401]);
    }
    
    // BJT用户权限检查
    $user = $GLOBALS['bjt_current_user'];
    if (!$user || $user->status !== 'active') {
        return new WP_Error('rest_forbidden', 'User not available', ['status' => 403]);
    }
    
    // 角色权限检查
    $has_permission = ($user->role === 'admin') ||
                      (isset($user->permissions) && 
                       in_array('edit_products', $user->permissions));
    
    if (!$has_permission) {
        return new WP_Error('rest_forbidden', 'Permission denied', ['status' => 403]);
    }
    
    return true;
}
```

### 前端数据处理模板：
```typescript
const onFinish = async (values: any) => {
  try {
    setSubmitting(true);
    
    // 1. 数据清理
    const cleanedValues = Object.fromEntries(
      Object.entries(values).filter(([_, value]) => 
        value !== '' && value !== null && value !== undefined
      )
    );
    
    // 2. 字段映射和类型转换
    const formData = {
      // 根据实际API要求映射字段
      field1: String(cleanedValues.field1 || ''),
      field2: Number(cleanedValues.field2) || undefined,
      field3: cleanedValues.field3 ? String(cleanedValues.field3) : undefined,
    };
    
    // 3. 过滤undefined值
    const finalData = Object.fromEntries(
      Object.entries(formData).filter(([_, value]) => value !== undefined)
    );
    
    // 4. 提交数据
    if (isEditMode) {
      await service.updateItem(id, finalData);
    } else {
      await service.createItem(finalData);
    }
    
    message.success('操作成功');
    navigate('/admin/list');
    
  } catch (error) {
    console.error('操作失败:', error);
    message.error(`操作失败: ${error instanceof Error ? error.message : '未知错误'}`);
  } finally {
    setSubmitting(false);
  }
};
```

